Description:

The iCalendar CLASS property now is enforced for calendar sharees, both in
CalDAV and JMAP, following the JMAP Calendars semantics for the JSCalendar
"privacy" property.

The CLASS property no longer is stripped from iTIP messages. It is preserved
for new invites (REQUEST) and for outgoing messages where the user is the
organizer, but changes to it are discarded for invite updates and for
replies (REPLY).


